Cell["\<\
The tapes at which a ring machine step ends are the ring machine's tapes, so \
decoding keeps just those.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->211028077,ExpressionUUID->"6ced15fb-d7c4-9b4f-b58b-56f4f43d0e40"],

